      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "HIGH CUBE (1) had a tricky draw last time and although midfield in fourth wasn't far away finishing 4.5 lengths from the winner (29.67). Boasts a strong record from this draw with three wins and three minor placings from seven starts. Better than the latest run and deserves another chance. MISS CHAPO (2) turned in a plain effort last time when fifth at this track over 512m behind Compton Lizzie (29.84) in a Grade 3/4/5. Was in the money prior to that. Likely to play a prominent role. MEPUNGA INFRARED (4) was out of the placings last time when fifth at Horsham (23.49) but did record best time of the card when winning five back. Solid record here at the distance winning two races. Leading chance. OLLIE LIMES (8) has strong credentials from this draw.",
